diff --git a/inan.md b/inan.md
index fa861a5..8939d01 100644
--- a/inan.md
+++ b/inan.md
@@ -255,8 +255,8 @@ All endpoints require **admin** role.
 | `GET` | `/admin/users` | List all users with role, plan status, account status. |
 | `POST` | `/admin/users/{user_id}/activate` | Reactivate a deactivated user and restore their plan (alias). |
 | `POST` | `/admin/users/{user_id}/reactivate` | Reactivate a deactivated user, restore their previous role, active plan, and list restored activities (e.g. `create_products`, `manage_shops`). |
-| `POST` | `/admin/users/{user_id}/deactivate` | Deactivate a user account (login allowed as `viewer`). |
-| `PATCH` | `/admin/users/{user_id}/role` | Change user role (`owner` / `viewer`). Body: `{ "role": "viewer" }`. Admins are not set here — use admin list. |
+| `POST` | `/admin/users/{user_id}/deactivate` | Deactivate a **non-admin** user (login allowed as `viewer`). **Administrators cannot be deactivated.** |
+| `PATCH` | `/admin/users/{user_id}/role` | Change user role (`owner` / `viewer`). **Admins cannot be upgraded or downgraded** — admin role is permanent via `ADMIN_LIST_JSON` / `admin.json`. |
 | `GET` | `/admin/role-keeper` | Read MongoDB role keeper (owner/viewer phone → role map). |
 | `PUT` | `/admin/role-keeper` | Update role keeper mappings. Admins cannot be added here. |
 | `GET` | `/admin/admins` | View loaded admin list (from env vars + `admin.json`). |
@@ -267,6 +267,8 @@ All endpoints require **admin** role.
 | `GET` | `/admin/plan-applications` | List all plan applications (shop name, identity, location, requested plan, switch status). |
 | `GET` | `/admin/waitlist` | Alias for `/admin/plan-applications`. |
 
+**Admin role is immutable:** registry admins (`ADMIN_LIST_JSON` / `ADMIN_PHONE` / `admin.json`) always stay `admin` on login/refresh. They are never demoted to viewer by plan expiry or deactivate. If an admin manages shops and a shop owner is deactivated, the admin still logs in as admin and can reactivate that shop from the admin console.
+
 **Admin access in production (Render):**
 ```
 ADMIN_LIST_JSON={"+918340300635":"admin","admin@example.com":"admin"}
